\":5,\"internal_linking\":0,\"originality\":3,\"factual_accuracy\":5}', 'published', '2026-07-31T23:59:03.000000Z', '2026-08-30T23:59:03.000000Z', NULL, '2026-08-30T21:11:49.000000Z', '2026-08-31T15:02:15.000000Z');
