\":3,\"commercial_value\":4,\"conversion_clarity\":3,\"ux_readability\":5,\"internal_linking\":0,\"originality\":3,\"factual_accuracy\":5}', 'published', '2026-08-17T23:59:16.000000Z', '2026-08-30T23:59:16.000000Z', NULL, '2026-08-30T21:11:49.000000Z', '2026-08-31T15:02:24.000000Z');
