king\":0,\"originality\":3,\"factual_accuracy\":5}', 'published', '2026-08-22T23:59:23.000000Z', '2026-08-30T23:59:23.000000Z', NULL, '2026-08-30T21:11:50.000000Z', '2026-08-31T15:02:30.000000Z');
