                            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-1\">Truk Engkel (4 Roda)</h4>
                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Kapasitas muat: <strong>600 – 800 pcs</strong>. Sangat lincah untuk masuk ke gang perumahan padat.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">
                            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-1\">Colt Diesel Double (6 Roda)</h4>
                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Kapasitas muat: <strong>1.500 – 2.000 pcs</strong>. Paling ideal untuk proyek cluster dan ruko.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">
                            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-1\">Truk Fuso Tronton</h4>
                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Kapasitas muat: <strong>3.500 – 4.500 pcs</strong>. Solusi pasokan skala besar antar kota dan tender.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>', '3', '1', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-31T16:00:12.000000Z', '2026-08-31T16:00:12.000000Z');
