                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Sentuhan eksotis khas peristirahatan Bali dan paviliun pegunungan.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">
