                        </div>
                        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">
                            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-1\">Anti Lumut Hitam</h4>
                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Porositas sangat rendah yang mengeliminasi sarang pertumbuhan jamur.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">
