                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Kebutuhan presisi tepat 25 pcs per 1 m² luas dinding pasangan.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">
                            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-1\">Bobot Padat 3.8–4.2 kg</h4>
                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Kepadatan cetak tumbuk semi-kering yang kokoh dan tahan guncangan.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\">
                            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-1\">Garansi Bebas Pecah 100%</h4>
                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">Pengiriman langsung armada pabrik dengan penggantian baru di tempat.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>', '3', '1', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-31T16:35:26.000000Z', '2026-08-31T16:35:26.000000Z');
